  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core Notifications package provides a set of user notification and status indicator controls including Toast, Progress Bar, Spinner, Badge, Message, and Skeleton. These controls help communicate application state, progress, and alerts to users with rich visuals and animations. Features include auto-dismissal, action buttons, progress tracking, loading placeholders, inline messages, and badge counters. Ideal for improving user feedback and interactivity in ASP.NET Core web applications.",
